# Shell Layout Components Are Read-Only

The following files provide the application shell (TopBar + SideBar) and must **never** be modified:

- `src/components/AppTopBar.vue`
- `src/components/AppSideBar.vue`
- `src/assets/alayacare-logo-white.svg`
- `src/assets/alayacare-logo-a.svg`

These are static scaffolding that replicates the production webapp layout from `accloud-shell-layout-blocks-service`. They are intentionally non-functional and should remain unchanged across all prototypes.

If a user asks to change the top bar, sidebar, or logo, explain that these are locked scaffolding components shared across prototypes and should not be customized. Prototype work should happen inside `src/views/` and `src/components/` (excluding the two files above).
